    {
      "text": "he who thrusts in sickle shall treasure up everlasting salvation, D&C 6:3 (11:3; 12:3; 14:3). treasure up these words in thy heart, D&C 6:20 (43:34). blessings of the Spirit are greater than corruptible treasures of earth, D&C 19:38. treasure up wisdom, D&C 38:30. he who sends treasures to Zion shall receive inheritance, D&C 63:48. treasure up in your minds words of life, D&C 84:85. those who obey Word of Wisdom shall find great treasures of knowledge, even hidden treasures, D&C 89:19. the Lord has much treasure in Salem for benefit of Zion, D&C 111:2. those in north countries shall bring rich treasures unto children of Ephraim, D&C 133:30.",
